% build-oracle findings — what dispatches to the build-system oracle PAID to learn.
%
% ⚑ THIS SURFACE'S CHARACTERISTIC DEFECT IS THE RESTATED CONSTANT: MEM_CAP was 128m at its
% authority and 256m in four other files, one of them the ratchet ENFORCING the cap. A number
% in a finding here is a fifth copy. Record CONTRACTS, HAZARDS and ORDERINGS; never a cap, a
% lease default, a timing figure or a module count — those have owning files and build_census
% regenerates them.
